          "html": "<section class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(40px,6vw,88px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,7vw,112px)\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px 48px;align-items:flex-end\">\n<div style=\"flex:999 1 560px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px\">\n<span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B5482F\">Travel guide · Liguria, Italy</span>\n<h1 class=\"disp\" style=\"margin:0;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(64px,9vw + 30px,160px);line-height:0.88;letter-spacing:-0.035em\"><span class=\"line\"><span>Five villages,</span></span><span class=\"line l2\"><span>walked <em style=\"color:#1F6F8B\">slowly.</em></span></span></h1>\n<p class=\"disp sub\" style=\"margin:0;max-width:30ch;font-size:clamp(21px,0.4vw + 20px,26px);line-height:1.4;font-style:italic;text-wrap:pretty\">Stories, stays and trails from the five villages of the Ligurian Riviera — linked by train, boat and footpath.</p>\n<div class=\"sub\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-p\" href=\"#\">Explore the villages <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-s\" href=\"#\">Plan your trip <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"background:#0B1622;color:#EDE7DB;padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n<span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8826A\">Today on the coast</span>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1\">[°]</span><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9AA4AE\">SEA</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1\">[°]</span><span class=\