          "html": "<section style=\"margin-top:clamp(72px,8vw,128px);background:#0B1622;color:#EDE7DB\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(56px,6vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px,6vw,96px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px 48px;align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"flex:999 1 520px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n<span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8826A\">Signature itinerary · 4 days · Moderate</span>\n<h2 class=\"disp\" style=\"margin:0;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(44px,3.2vw + 26px,88px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">The Salt &amp; <em>Stone</em> Path</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:52ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9CED3\">Riomaggiore to Monterosso over four slow days — terraces to Volastra, a morning boat to Vernazza, the Blue Trail to finish. Best April–June or September–October.</p>\n<div><a class=\"btn btn-l\" href=\"#\">Read the itinerary <span class=\"arr\">→</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<ol style=\"flex:1 1 320px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #2A3846\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;color:#E8826A\">I</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">The Gravity of Arrival</strong><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9AA4AE\">Riomaggiore</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #2A3846\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;color:#E8826A\">II</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">The High Silence</strong><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9AA4AE\">Manarola → Corniglia</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #2A3846\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;color:#E8826A\">III</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">The Vertical Heart</strong><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9AA4AE\">Vernazza</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #2A3846;border-bottom:1px solid #2A3846\"><span class=\"disp\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1;color:#E8826A\">IV</span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600\">The Soft Horizon</strong><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9AA4AE\">Monterosso</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</section>"
